      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Merrill%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Originally called Jenny Bull Falls, the community was later renamed Merrill in honor of a railroad general manager.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
